OL,3,GNEWSAWhy did Dolly Parton record a song
OL,4,Ain Welsh?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Welsh language collaboration between
OL,7,FDolly Parton, her niece Jada Star and
OL,8,Fsinger-songwriter Bronwen Lewis might
OL,9,Fnot have been on your bingo card for
OL,10,Fthis year.
OL,12,FBut their cover of smash-hit Jolene,
OL,13,Fwith Welsh and English lyrics, has been
OL,14,Freleased on Friday.
OL,16,FThe song, recorded before Parton's
OL,17,Fdeath on 25 August, is her second
OL,18,Fposthumous single.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
