OL,3,GNEWSAWhy did Dolly Parton record a song
OL,4,Ain Welsh?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teaser video released last week shows
OL,7,Fhow Parton spent some time
OL,8,Funderstanding the phonetics of Lewis'
OL,9,Ftranslation and recorded her parts at
OL,10,Fher studio in Nashville in early 2025.
